# This directory holds capture-evidence.sh's output, one dated subdirectory
# per live run (openshift/evidence/YYYY-MM-DD/). It stays empty in version
# control until a live run lands scrubbed evidence here (DRQ-104): ignore
# everything by default, then allow back in only the committed run(s) this
# project's maintainers have reviewed and scrubbed.
*
!.gitignore
# To commit a scrubbed run, uncomment and name it explicitly, e.g.:
# Reviewed + scrubbed headless CRC run (DRQ-104, ch.33 verified-live):
!2026-10-17/
!2026-10-17/**
